  "Scope": "Existing scalar VM admits a bounded exact literal-block repeat before VeryEnd without rewind records. At most64 unfolded scalars encode into fixed256B stack scratch; one original input-work unit before encoding/every\u003C=256B checked comparison and publication, with synchronous token/direct deadline. Base workspace, strict full validation, captures outside the block and result admission remain. Work/depth/storage costs intentionally decrease; no new plan/field/matcher/policy/mode or unchecked access. Eight equal-result public FullMatch range cases: actual13312B repeated Cyrillic with guarded digest, finite/live/deadline, supplementary offset, partial tail, captured/folded-body controls and unchanged exact-literal native control. Every lane consumes primary byte and derived UTF16 ranges; diagnostic predecoded/decode-then compiled .NET lanes include byte-coordinate projection and do not set public parity/Status. Warm1.5s/min64calls, independent60ms calibration, five alternating samples each\u003E=20ms; batches checked after timing. Construction/cold full-program preparation excluded. Default tiering/PGO, CPU2, one120s cap, at most one selected confirmation. Official CPython qualification is separate; no package/fullcatalog campaign.",
